{
  "slug": "cashflow",
  "name": "Cashflow",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Personal finance ledger for AI agents. Connect your bank accounts via Plaid, then query spending, track recurring bills, categorize transactions, and get financial recaps — all through MCP tools with OAuth authentication.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `benefits` (Screen for unclaimed safety-net benefits (EITC, SNAP, LIHEAP, WIC, Medicaid) using the user's Cashflow data, then generate a…), `burnrate` (Calculate total recurring financial obligations, break them down by category, and flag changes), `cards` (Triggered by \"optimize my cards\", \"which card should I use\", \"card recommendations\", \"maximize points\", \"credit card optimizer\", \"best…), `debt` (Build a debt payoff plan — inventory all debts (Plaid-connected and not), put a number on what the…), `drift` (Compare the last 12 months to the 12 before them and show whether expenses grew faster than income…), `enveloping` (Help the user set up or review an envelope budgeting system — physically separating non-discretionary bills from discretionary…), `leaks` (Comprehensive audit of money leaving the user's accounts in ways they're likely not tracking — subscriptions (active, zombie,…), `recap` (Generate a narrative financial review comparing spending, income, trends, and anomalies across any time period), and 3 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `cashflow`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cashflow@claude-community` from `cashflow-tech/plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 11,
    "mcp": 1
  },
